Hemmingway-1-GPTQ-Int4-sym-G128-MTP-BF16
Copyright 2026 Bjorn Nordblom (quantization)
=============================================

This distribution is a GPTQ INT4 (W4A16, group_size=128, symmetric,
desc_act=false) quantization of the model "Hemmingway-1"
(https://huggingface.co/Altworld/Hemmingway-1), which is built on
"Qwen3.8-27B" (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B).

Both source models are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Copyright and attribution for the source models remain with their respective
authors: Altworld (Hemmingway-1) and Alibaba Cloud (Qwen3.8-27B).

Modifications (2026, Bjorn Nordblom):
  - The linear projections of the 64 language-model layers were quantized to
    4-bit GPTQ weights with gptqmodel 7.3.2 on an Intel Arc Pro B70.
  - The 15 MTP (multi-token-prediction) draft-head tensors were preserved in
    their original BF16 dtype.
  - No changes were made to the model architecture, tokenizer, or chat
    template.

Full details, quantization configuration and reproduction instructions:
  https://github.com/BjornNordblom/intel-arc-b70-quant
